{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Kotobuki town</strong>, a quaint community currently being gobbled up acre by acre by dastardly big-city landsharks. It\u2019s also your new home. Do you have what it takes to bring the locals together and save their beloved sushi bar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by slice-of-life anime, <i>Sushi Ben</i> is a sweet, funny and bombastic narrative adventure about finding your feet in a new town (and sticking it to landlords while you\u2019re at it).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/93aa301ddcd789894c6ced8c9e4366dc.poster.avif?t=1758168608\" width=1170 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/93aa301ddcd789894c6ced8c9e4366dc.webm?t=1758168608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a gorgeous seaside setting, eye-popping 3D manga panels, a fully voiced cast of colorful characters, and plenty of minigames \u2013 fishing, archery, dog walking, and even ghost hunting...!?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With narrative talents of <strong>Hato Moa</strong> (<i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>) and voice acting by <strong>Laura Post</strong> (<i>Little Witch Academia</i>), <strong>Ryan Colt Levy</strong> (<i>Chainsaw Man</i>), <strong>AJ Beckles</strong> (<i>Dandadan</i>) and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>interactive anime story</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop out <strong>manga panels</strong> bring the tale to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful cast</strong> of small town characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome</strong> and <strong>over-the-top</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours of <strong>story quests!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ hours of <strong>mini-games</strong> - fishing, archery, ghost hunting and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in <strong>flatscreen</strong> and <strong>VR</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>voice acting</strong> from a stacked 20+ cast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative by the creator of <i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kei, Rare Bugs, and Jumping Shrimp!?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/5b9ad788612c37fc051a41927b6821aa2349c980.jpg"},{"name":"Shogo, Pot-chan, and Gangster Gulls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/cf7a2a740c0106cd81d9c90f02d3d4f4ec58f6f8.jpg"},{"name":"Hakuren the Carving Artist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/9c7235a5b04aa6b83ada60f3d56f5d3e03207df8.jpg"},{"name":"Ofukuro, Botan, and the Haunting in Room 202","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/368bdd9fbf3ca41084898a54fc629e0bed1770f8.jpg"},{"name":"Kyo and Ray's Magical Lazy Shrine Tour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/37bcfaaea00e0aeb1b6eeea6d10ec933be42c5d5.jpg"},{"name":"Aika: the Tiger of Kotobuki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/476ad3aab76e8751fe041245135311562c73d444.jpg"},{"name":"Ryourin and Shrine Maintenance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/1e36d8715ac8fad2bfb9cdefb84747be66bb1e4f.jpg"},{"name":"Yukihira, Watson, and a Really Cool Stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419240/2b9b3a00c1ff088ea5fee377db5